<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS views cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS views cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Peter Swartz reduced his earning estimates for Cisco Systems Inc to $2 per share from $2.09 for 1997 and to $2.60 from $2.85 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Repeated buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Said transitions in company's current technology and products, along with general industry sluggishness in some customer segments and geographic regions &quot;will post significant challenges&quot; in company hitting analyst's previous estimates.</p>
<p>-- Shares shed 3-9/16 to 49-11/16.</p>
</text>
